Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.92,0:00:08.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here's the problem with teleportation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.92,0:00:08.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瞬间转移的问题就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:12.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Lay it on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:12.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说来听听
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.85,0:00:14.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Assuming a device could be invented...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.85,0:00:14.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}假设这样的设备被研制出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.81,0:00:18.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which would identify the state of matter of an individual in one location...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.81,0:00:18.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它能确定特定位置个体的物质量子态
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.64,0:00:21.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and transmit that to a distant location for reassembly...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.64,0:00:21.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后将其转移到另外一处重新装配组合
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.65,0:00:23.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you wouldn't have transported the individual...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.65,0:00:23.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上这不算传送
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:29.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you would have destroyed him in one location and re-created him in another.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:29.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而是把它在一处销毁 在另一处重建
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:32.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:32.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的分析好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:34.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I would never use a transporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:34.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我永远不会使用传输机
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.99,0:00:37.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The original Sheldon would have to be disintegrated...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.99,0:00:37.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为原来的谢尔顿必须先被分解掉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.83,0:00:40.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in order to create a new Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.83,0:00:40.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才能创造出新的谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:45.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would the new Sheldon be in any way an improvement on the old Sheldon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:45.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}新谢尔顿会不会比原来的谢尔顿要好点？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.04,0:00:48.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, he would be exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.04,0:00:48.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 还是和原来一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.51,0:00:50.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.51,0:00:50.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那这就是问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.55,0:00:51.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you see it too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.55,0:00:51.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你也是这么想的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:54.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Hofstadter, Dr. Cooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:54.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍夫斯塔特博士 库珀博士
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.06,0:00:56.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}BOTH: Dr. Gablehauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.06,0:00:56.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-盖博豪瑟博士 -盖博豪瑟博士
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.43,0:00:58.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gentlemen, I'd like you to meet Dennis Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.43,0:00:58.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}两位 这位是丹尼斯金
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.98,0:01:01.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dennis is a highly sought-after doctoral candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.98,0:01:01.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}丹尼斯是各方争相邀请的博士候选人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.98,0:01:04.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're hoping to have him do graduate work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.98,0:01:04.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们希望他能来这里读硕士
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.27,0:01:06.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Graduate work, very impressive. -And he's only 15 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.27,0:01:06.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}硕士啊 了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.07,0:01:11.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not bad. I myself started graduate school at 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.07,0:01:08.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他只有15岁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.19,0:01:11.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不错嘛 我是14岁开始读研究生的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:15.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I lost a year while my family was tunneling out of North Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:15.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们一家从北朝鲜挖地洞逃出来时 我休学了一年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.62,0:01:20.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Advantage, Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.62,0:01:20.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}占上风者 金
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.96,0:01:23.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought maybe you could show Dennis around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.96,0:01:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们带丹尼斯四处参观一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.21,0:01:26.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let him see why we're the best physics research facility in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.21,0:01:26.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让他知道我们这里为什么是 全国最优秀的物理研究机构
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.71,0:01:27.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.71,0:01:27.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你们这里不是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:31.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't have an Open Science Grid computer or a free electron laser.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:31.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们没有开放科学网格计算机或自由电子激光器
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:34.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The string theory research being done is a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:34.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且这里的弦理论研究已经进入死胡同了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.18,0:01:37.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, that is my research, and it is by no means a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.18,0:01:37.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 那是我的研究 才没有走进死胡同
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.06,0:01:41.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, obviously, you don't see it yet, but trust me, you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.06,0:01:41.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}显然 你还没看出来 相信我 你迟早会发现的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.85,0:01:43.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}丹尼斯 我们讨论过这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.90,0:01:45.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dennis, we've discussed this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.65,0:01:48.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're in the process of updating our equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.65,0:01:48.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们正在更新我们的仪器
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.19,0:01:50.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We welcome your input on our research goals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.19,0:01:50.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}欢迎你对我们的研究目标提出建言
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.53,0:01:53.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We agree to look the other way if you use 20 percent...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.53,0:01:53.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你打算把申请到的科研基金 拿出百分之20来帮助你外公
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.24,0:01:56.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of the money you attract to smuggle your grandfather out of Pyongyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.24,0:01:56.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把他从平壤弄出来 我们会假装不知情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.28,0:02:00.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We want him here, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.28,0:02:00.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们需要他 两位
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.58,0:02:02.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Make it happen. -Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.58,0:02:02.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你们一定要成功 -遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.25,0:02:04.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can count on us. We're on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.25,0:02:04.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}包在我们身上 绝对没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.25,0:02:06.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What the hell do you mean, "dead end"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.25,0:02:06.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是什么意思 死胡同？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.96,0:02:09.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, the whole landscape of false vacuums in string theory...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.96,0:02:09.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}弦理论的虚假真空领域
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.09,0:02:12.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...could be as large as 10 to the 500th power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.09,0:02:12.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有可能大到10的500次方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.51,0:02:13.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In addition--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.51,0:02:13.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除此之外
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.76,0:02:15.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, look, chocolate milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.76,0:02:15.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瞧…巧克力牛奶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:21.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I sense a disturbance in the force.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:21.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我察觉到原力有波动
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.22,0:02:24.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IMITATING YODA] A bad feeling I have about this. Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.22,0:02:24.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我对这事有不祥的预感
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:50.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So how long have you been in America?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:50.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}丹尼斯 你来美国多久了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.96,0:02:52.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-A year and a half. -No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.96,0:02:52.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-一年半 -真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.59,0:02:55.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You speak English really well. -So do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.59,0:02:55.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你英文讲得很好 -你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.22,0:03:00.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Except for your tendency to end sentences with prepositions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.22,0:03:00.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除了你倾向在句子的结尾用介词之外
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.93,0:03:03.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.93,0:03:03.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.31,0:03:06.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.31,0:03:06.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像刚才那样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:08.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:08.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.94,0:03:11.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, and this is my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.94,0:03:11.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 这里是我的办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.36,0:03:14.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Is this part of the tour? -Nope. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.36,0:03:14.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这是参观的一部分吗？ -不是 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.86,0:03:17.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, we've hardly shown him anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.86,0:03:17.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我们根本没带他看什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.07,0:03:20.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, this is my desk. These are my books.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.07,0:03:20.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 这是我的桌子 这些是我的书
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.87,0:03:23.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is my door. Please close it behind you, goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.87,0:03:23.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是我的门 出去时请把门带上 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.83,0:03:28.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're doing work in quantum loop corrections.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.83,0:03:28.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看来你正在做环圈量子校正
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.33,0:03:33.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Keen observation, goodbye. -You see where you went wrong, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.33,0:03:33.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你很有观察力 再见 -你知道自己错在哪里了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.88,0:03:35.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Leonard. -Ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.88,0:03:35.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:38.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah? -Get him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:38.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么了？ -把他带走
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.93,0:03:42.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come, I'll show you the rec center. They've got Nautilus equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.93,0:03:42.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}走吧 丹尼斯 我带你去看娱乐中心 那里有健身器材
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.22,0:03:44.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do I look like I lift weights?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.22,0:03:44.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看着像是练器械的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.22,0:03:47.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not heavy ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.22,0:03:47.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是那种重的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.77,0:03:51.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's startling you haven't considered a Lorentz invariant or field theory approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.77,0:03:51.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真没想到 你居然没考虑洛伦兹不变量或场论
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.57,0:03:54.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You think I haven't considered it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.57,0:03:54.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你以为我没考虑过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.36,0:03:57.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You really think I haven't considered it? -Have you considered it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.36,0:03:57.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你真的以为我没考虑过吗？ -你真的考虑过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.32,0:04:00.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Get him out, Leonard. -Come on, Dennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.32,0:04:00.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把他弄走 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.62,0:04:04.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll show you the radiation lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.62,0:04:02.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}走吧 丹尼斯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.12,0:04:04.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我带你去看辐射实验室
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.70,0:04:06.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow. You won the Stevenson Award?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.70,0:04:06.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得过史蒂文森奖？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.20,0:04:11.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. In fact, I am the youngest person ever to win it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.20,0:04:11.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 我是有史以来最年轻的得奖者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.46,0:04:13.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? How old?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.46,0:04:13.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的？你当时多大？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.75,0:04:15.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fourteen and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.75,0:04:15.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}十四岁半
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:17.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mm. You were the youngest ever to win it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:17.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你曾经是最年轻的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.22,0:04:23.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's like looking into an obnoxious mirror, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.22,0:04:23.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就好像看到了自己讨人厌的缩小版 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.98,0:04:31.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mm. This is really delicious, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.98,0:04:31.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的很好吃 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.73,0:04:38.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Still can't talk to me unless you're drunk, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.73,0:04:38.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还是没喝醉就不敢和我说话？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.99,0:04:43.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, sweetie, you are so damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.99,0:04:43.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的 你受到的伤害真大
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.12,0:04:46.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, I'm damaged too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.12,0:04:46.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 我受的伤害也很大
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.95,0:04:49.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about a hug for Howie?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.95,0:04:49.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给霍华德一个拥抱如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.50,0:04:52.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure. Raj, hug Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.50,0:04:52.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没问题 拉吉 抱一下霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.17,0:04:55.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SHELDON SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:58.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Something you'd like to share?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:58.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有什么故事想跟我们分享吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.47,0:05:01.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A tale of woe perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.47,0:05:01.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许是一个悲惨的故事？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.34,0:05:03.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fifteen years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.34,0:05:03.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}15岁
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.85,0:05:07.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dennis Kim is 15 years old and he's already correcting my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.85,0:05:07.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}丹尼斯金才15岁便会纠正我的研究
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.85,0:05:11.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Today, I went from being Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart to....
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.85,0:05:11.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天我从天才神童 沃尔夫冈阿玛多伊斯莫扎特变成了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:13.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, that other guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:13.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道的 那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:14.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Antonio Salieri?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:14.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}安东尼奥萨列里？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.44,0:05:18.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God, now even you're smarter than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.44,0:05:18.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老天 现在连你都比我聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.32,0:05:23.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, you don't have so many friends that you can afford to start insulting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.32,0:05:23.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你没那么多朋友 可以供你随意侮辱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:26.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just eat, Sheldon. You'll feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:26.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吃饭吧 谢尔顿 你心情会好一点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.87,0:05:28.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why waste food?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.87,0:05:28.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}干嘛浪费食物？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.29,0:05:30.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When a cow goes dry, they don't keep feeding it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.29,0:05:30.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在德州 若牛的乳汁变少 他们就不会继续喂它
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:34.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...they just take her out and shoot her between the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:34.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们只会把它拉出去一枪崩掉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:38.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm confused. Did Sheldon stop giving milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:38.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有些搞不懂 谢尔顿不再分泌乳汁了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.13,0:05:40.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't let this kid get to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.13,0:05:40.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别让这个小孩影响到你的情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.01,0:05:44.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You knew that someday, someone would come along who's younger and smarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.01,0:05:44.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你早该知道迟早会有人比你更年轻更聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.64,0:05:47.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but I assumed I would've been dead hundreds of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.64,0:05:47.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 但我以为是在我过世几百年之后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.47,0:05:51.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And that there'd be an asterisk by his name because he'd be a cyborg.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.47,0:05:51.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个人的名字旁会注上星号因为他是生化机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.31,0:05:55.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you got a little competition. I really don't see what the big deal is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.31,0:05:55.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你遇到了竞争对手又如何？我觉得这没什么大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:06:00.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course you don't. You've never excelled at anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:06:00.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你当然觉得无所谓 因为你从未在任何领域出人头地
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.99,0:06:04.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't understand, exactly how did he get any friends in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.99,0:06:02.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.57,0:06:04.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他怎么会有朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.53,0:06:07.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We liked Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.53,0:06:07.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们喜欢莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.54,0:06:11.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you gonna do, just give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.54,0:06:11.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你打算怎么办 谢尔顿 就这样放弃吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.83,0:06:16.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, it's what a rational person does when his entire life's work is invalidated...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.83,0:06:16.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的 当一个理性之人的毕生努力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.75,0:06:19.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...by a postpubescent Asian wunderkind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.75,0:06:19.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}被一个亚洲毛头小子天才一语抹煞
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.17,0:06:24.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He ceases his fruitless efforts, he donates his body to scientific research...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.17,0:06:24.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他决定终止无结果的努力 把身体捐给科学研究
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.84,0:06:27.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and he waits to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.84,0:06:27.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后等候死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.56,0:06:33.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm confused again. Is he waiting, or do we get to shoot him between the eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.56,0:06:29.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我又不明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:33.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们是该让他等下去 还是直接把他拉出去崩了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.77,0:06:37.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey. -Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.77,0:06:37.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿 -嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.73,0:06:39.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've decided you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.73,0:06:39.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我决定了 你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.27,0:06:41.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-My career is not over. -Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.27,0:06:41.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我的事业生涯还没完 -太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.61,0:06:44.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But since Dennis Kim has rendered my research pointless...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.61,0:06:44.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过 既然丹尼斯金说我的研究毫无意义
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.82,0:06:47.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I just have to find something else to focus on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.82,0:06:47.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就换个研究方向好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.53,0:06:48.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.53,0:06:48.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.74,0:06:51.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I've decided I'm going to collaborate with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.74,0:06:51.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我决定跟你合作
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:56.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:56.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.29,0:06:58.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what exactly is it you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.29,0:06:58.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是哪个领域的？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.17,0:07:03.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know you chatter on about it all the time, but I've never really paid attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.17,0:07:03.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你一直讲个不停 但我从未专心听过
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.92,0:07:07.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right now, I'm designing an experiment to study the soft component...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.92,0:07:07.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在我在设计一套实验 研究海平面上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:10.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of cosmic radiation at sea level, but I don't need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:10.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}宇宙射线的软成分 但我不需要帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.22,0:07:12.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, sure you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.22,0:07:12.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你当然需要
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.72,0:07:15.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now see, what's this here in the schematic, a laser array?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.72,0:07:15.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这图表上是什么？是激光阵列吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.56,0:07:17.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yes. -Now, hmm....
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.56,0:07:17.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是的 -好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.61,0:07:23.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What happens if you use argon lasers instead of helium-neon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.61,0:07:23.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果用氩激光取代氦氖激光呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.86,0:07:25.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It would blow up. -Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.86,0:07:25.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就会爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:29.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Pretty sure. -"Pretty sure" is not very scientific.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:28.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你确定？ -我挺确定的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.11,0:07:29.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}科学要的不是“挺确定的”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:33.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is this how you normally work? Just hunches and guesses and stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:33.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你平常都是这种工作态度？用直觉大约猜测的？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.87,0:07:35.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.87,0:07:35.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.58,0:07:38.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I understand that you're going through a bit of a career crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.58,0:07:38.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我知道你现在正面临职业生涯危机
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.79,0:07:42.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're searching for some other area where you can feel valuable and productive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.79,0:07:42.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想探索其他能让你觉得有价值 有创造力的工作领域
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:45.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I need to tell you something, and listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:45.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我得告诉你一件事 请你听清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.21,0:07:48.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-All right. -Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.21,0:07:48.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好的 -走开
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.84,0:07:55.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you're concerned about sharing credit with me, your name can go first-- I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.84,0:07:55.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你若担心排名问题 你的名字可以排在前面…我这就走
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.44,0:08:02.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a small brown paper bag, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.44,0:08:02.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是个灰色的小纸袋 妈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.32,0:08:05.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm looking at it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.32,0:08:05.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我现在正在看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.53,0:08:10.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would I make that up? There's no Ding Dong in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.53,0:08:06.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我干嘛要捏造事实？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.90,0:08:09.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}里面根本没有巧克力夹心蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.70,0:08:16.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How are two Ding Dongs tomorrow gonna help me today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.70,0:08:16.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天什么都吃不到 明天给我 两份巧克力夹心蛋糕有什么用？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:20.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So this is Engineering, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:20.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里便是工程部啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.58,0:08:22.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll talk to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.58,0:08:22.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我晚点再打给你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.88,0:08:25.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Engineering, where the noble semiskilled laborers...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.88,0:08:25.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}工程部 就是几个高尚的半熟练工人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:28.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...execute the vision of those who think and dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:28.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}执行那些有思想、有梦想的人所构思的远景
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.88,0:08:32.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, Oompa Loompas of science.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.88,0:08:32.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 科学界的小侏儒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.39,0:08:36.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.39,0:08:36.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你来这里干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:38.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just came by to say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:38.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是过来打声招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.89,0:08:41.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For three years, you've never come by to say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.89,0:08:41.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}三年来 你从没来这里打过招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:44.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, up until now, I've had better things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:44.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}之前我一直忙着更重要的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.61,0:08:47.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what are we making today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.61,0:08:47.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你今天在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.48,0:08:51.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A small payload support structure for a European science experimental package...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.48,0:08:51.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}替欧洲的一项科学实验装置制做装载支持结构
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.07,0:08:55.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...that's going up on the next space shuttle. -Really? How does it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.07,0:08:53.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}下次火箭发射时要用
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.87,0:08:55.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？它是怎么运作的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.58,0:08:58.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It will be attached to the payload bay...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.58,0:08:58.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}做好之后 它会被安装在火箭的载运台上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.16,0:09:01.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and the sensor apparatus will rest on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.16,0:09:01.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}上面会放上感应设备
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.17,0:09:03.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Aha.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.54,0:09:06.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So it's a shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.54,0:09:06.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以就是个架子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.30,0:09:10.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.30,0:09:10.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 你不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.63,0:09:14.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}During acceleration, it needs to stay perfectly level and provide--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.63,0:09:14.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在加速推进时 它必须保持绝对平衡状态 并提供…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.10,0:09:15.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, okay, it's a shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.10,0:09:15.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 还是个架子嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.01,0:09:17.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I notice you're using titanium.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.01,0:09:17.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我注意到你使用钛金属
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.72,0:09:20.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you give any consideration to carbon nanotubes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.72,0:09:20.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有没有考虑过使用纳米碳管？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.23,0:09:23.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're lighter, cheaper and have twice the tensile strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.23,0:09:23.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它们更轻便 也更便宜 抗张强度还是原来的两倍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.35,0:09:29.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, there's a diploma in my office that says I have a master's in engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.35,0:09:29.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我办公室里有我的工程学硕士学位证书
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.11,0:09:33.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you also have a note from your mother that says, "I love you, Bubula."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.11,0:09:33.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有一张你妈妈写给你的字条说“我爱你 小可爱”
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.78,0:09:38.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But neither of those is a cogent argument for titanium over nanotubes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.78,0:09:38.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但这些都不能说明钛金属比纳米碳管好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.37,0:09:40.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon. -Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.37,0:09:40.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 -什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.79,0:09:43.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.79,0:09:43.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}走开
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.58,0:09:45.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did Leonard tell you to say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.58,0:09:45.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是莱纳德教你这么说的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.71,0:09:47.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I thought of it all by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.71,0:09:47.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 是我自己想出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.38,0:09:52.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Huh? Can't be a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.38,0:09:52.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不可能只是巧合
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:56.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There must be some causal link I'm missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:56.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一定有某种我没发现到的因果关系
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.39,0:10:01.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.39,0:10:01.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}走开
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.69,0:10:12.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Curiouser and curiouser.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.69,0:10:12.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这事越来越古怪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.24,0:10:18.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Is he here? -If he were, I wouldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.24,0:10:16.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他在这里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.70,0:10:18.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他要是在 我就不会在了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.12,0:10:21.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what he did? He watched me work...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.12,0:10:21.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道他做了什么吗？他盯着我工作十分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.58,0:10:26.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and then started to design a simple piece of software that could replace me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.58,0:10:26.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后便开始设计一个可以取代我的简单软体
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.08,0:10:28.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.08,0:10:28.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有那个可能吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.67,0:10:30.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As it turns out, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.67,0:10:30.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.26,0:10:35.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Something's gotta be done about him. -Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.26,0:10:35.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们必须想个办法对付他 -比如说？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.01,0:10:38.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He'll never cope with the fact that some 15-year-old is smarter...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.01,0:10:40.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他永远无法忍受一个15岁小孩 比他更聪明 成就更高
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.43,0:10:40.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and more accomplished than he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.89,0:10:45.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if something were to happen to him so he was no longer a threat to Sheldon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.89,0:10:45.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果这孩子出点什么事 对谢尔顿不再产生威胁了呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.44,0:10:49.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then our problem would be solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.44,0:10:49.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我们的问题就能得到解决
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.61,0:10:52.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hang on, are we talking about murdering Dennis Kim?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.61,0:10:52.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等 你们是说谋杀丹尼斯金吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.61,0:10:55.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not saying no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.61,0:10:55.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有反对的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.36,0:10:59.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We don't have to go that far. There are other means.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.36,0:10:59.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不用走到那一步 肯定有别的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.32,0:11:02.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We can't send him back to North Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.32,0:11:02.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不能把他送回北朝鲜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.00,0:11:03.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He knows how to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.00,0:11:03.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他知道如何逃出来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.71,0:11:09.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The only thing we need to do is make this Kim kid lose his focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.71,0:11:09.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们唯一能做的就是分散金的注意力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.25,0:11:12.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It won't happen. He is not interested in anything but physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.25,0:11:12.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不可能 他只对物理感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.30,0:11:14.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What about biology? -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.30,0:11:14.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那生物呢？ -什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.17,0:11:17.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, biology.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.17,0:11:17.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道 “生物”嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.34,0:11:20.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The one thing that can completely derail a world-class mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.34,0:11:20.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}唯一能混淆世界级大师思绪的玩意儿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.43,0:11:22.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Howard, he's 15. -Yeah, so?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.43,0:11:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-霍华德 他才15岁 -那又如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.64,0:11:24.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I was 15, I met Denise Palmeri...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.64,0:11:24.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我15岁时 遇见丹妮丝帕玛莉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.60,0:11:28.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and my grade point average fell from a 5.0 to a 1.8.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.60,0:11:28.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结果我的平均绩点从5,0下跌倒了1,8
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.86,0:11:30.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She was sleeping with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.86,0:11:30.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她和你上床了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.61,0:11:35.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I just wasted a lot of time thinking about what it would be like if she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.61,0:11:35.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有 我只是浪费很多时间幻想和她上床的滋味
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.53,0:11:38.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, good, you're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.53,0:11:38.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了 你们都在
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:42.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've decided that if the three of you drop whatever you're working on and join me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:42.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想好了 如果你们三个放弃你们的研究跟我合作
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.62,0:11:47.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we could lick cold fusion in less than a decade, 12 years tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.62,0:11:47.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们可以在10年内 攻破冷核聚变的难题 最多12年
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.33,0:11:50.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.33,0:11:50.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}走开？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.84,0:11:54.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.59,0:11:55.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Could it be me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.59,0:11:55.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我的问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:01.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, guys, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:01.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.05,0:12:04.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We need a hot 15-year-old Asian girl with a thing for smart guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.05,0:12:04.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们需要一个喜欢聪明男人的15岁亚洲辣妹
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.43,0:12:07.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -Howard, that's racist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.43,0:12:07.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？ -霍华德 那是种族歧视
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.23,0:12:10.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Any 15-year-old girl will do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.23,0:12:10.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}随便一个15岁的女孩都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.19,0:12:19.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's possible she may have misunderstood us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.19,0:12:19.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她有可能误会我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.53,0:12:25.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.37,0:12:28.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Dr. Cooper. Oh, are we interrupting? -No, no, please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.37,0:12:28.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-库珀博士 没有打扰到你吧？ -没有…请进吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:31.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think you'll appreciate this. This is very exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:31.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想你一定会很喜欢 这简直太令人兴奋了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.38,0:12:33.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What are you working on? -Something remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.38,0:12:33.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你在做什么研究？ -一件意义非凡的事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.71,0:12:38.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Since my prospects for the Nobel Prize in Physics have disappeared-- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.71,0:12:38.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}既然我得诺贝尔物理奖无望 全拜你所赐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.22,0:12:41.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}--I've decided to refocus my efforts and use my people skills...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.22,0:12:41.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我决定调整研究方向 并运用我的人际技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:43.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to win the Nobel Peace Prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:43.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}争取赢得诺贝尔和平奖
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.47,0:12:46.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I'm going to solve the Middle East crisis...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.47,0:12:46.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 我要解决中东问题
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.10,0:12:50.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...by building an exact replica of Jerusalem in the middle of the Mexican desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.10,0:12:50.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}通过在墨西哥沙漠里复制搭建一座耶路撒冷城
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.52,0:12:52.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To what end?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.52,0:12:52.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这么做的目的是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.77,0:12:57.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, it's like the baseball movie. "Build it and they will come."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.77,0:12:57.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就像棒球电影演的 球场盖在哪 人就会跟到哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.90,0:12:59.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who will come?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.90,0:12:59.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁会去？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.15,0:13:00.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Jewish people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.15,0:13:00.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}犹太人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.20,0:13:02.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if they don't come?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.20,0:13:02.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}万一他们不去呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.62,0:13:04.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll make it nice, put out a spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.62,0:13:04.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们做好一点 准备点好吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.95,0:13:08.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, speaking of spreads...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.95,0:13:11.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的 说到好吃的 我们下午 要为金先生举行一场小型欢迎派对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.00,0:13:10.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we're having a welcoming party this afternoon for Mr. Kim...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.08,0:13:15.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...who's agreed to join us at the university. -Of course he has.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.08,0:13:15.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他已经同意加入这所大学 -当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.13,0:13:19.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The oracle told us little Neo was the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.13,0:13:19.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先知早就说过 小尼奥是救世主
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.42,0:13:22.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can see the matrix, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.42,0:13:22.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能看到矩阵 对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.18,0:13:27.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, obviously, you're very busy with your, ah, um....
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.18,0:13:27.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 显然你正忙着做…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.10,0:13:28.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come, Dennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.10,0:13:28.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们走 丹尼斯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:34.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'll have to excuse Dr. Cooper. He's been under a lot of, um....
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:34.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请你别介意库珀博士 他最近承受了许多…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.06,0:13:36.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.06,0:13:36.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他这人疯疯癫癫的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.94,0:13:39.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SHELDON HUMMING "CIELITO LINDO"]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.61,0:13:41.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SINGING IN HEBREW]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.24,0:13:46.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They'll come, they'll settle And I'll win the prize
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.24,0:13:46.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们会来的 他们会来定居 然后我就能得诺贝尔奖
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.66,0:13:50.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't understand your objections, Professor Goldfarb.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.66,0:13:50.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不明白你为何反对 戈德法布教授
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.54,0:13:54.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why wouldn't the Sonora Desert make a perfectly good Promised Land?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.54,0:13:54.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么索诺拉沙漠不能当上帝的应许之地？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:56.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:56.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}走开
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.71,0:14:00.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We could call it Nuevo Jerusalem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.71,0:14:00.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们可以称之为“新耶路撒冷”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.26,0:14:03.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.26,0:14:03.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请你走开
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.84,0:14:06.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Said Pharaoh to Moses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.84,0:14:06.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}法老对摩西下驱逐令
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.26,0:14:09.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why are all these young women here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.26,0:14:09.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么这里这么多年轻女孩？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.43,0:14:11.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's Take Your Daughter to Work Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.43,0:14:11.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天是“带女儿上班”日
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.81,0:14:13.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? I was not aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.81,0:14:13.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？我怎么不知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.52,0:14:15.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yes. There was a very official e-mail...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.52,0:14:15.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的 有一封很正式的电子邮件
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.98,0:14:18.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that was sent to everyone whose files indicated...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.98,0:14:18.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}发送给了所有资料上显示
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.78,0:14:21.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...they had daughters between the ages of 14 and 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.78,0:14:21.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们的女儿在14到16岁之间的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:22.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.15,0:14:25.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Smooth. -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.15,0:14:25.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不错 -谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.53,0:14:29.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's the man of the hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.53,0:14:29.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天的主角来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.08,0:14:34.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So we have a socially awkward genius in a room of attractive age-appropriate women.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.08,0:14:34.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在这位有交际障碍的天才 和一群可爱的姑娘共处一室
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:36.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All he has to do is hook up with one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:36.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他只需勾搭上一个就好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.38,0:14:48.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyone else see the flaw in this plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.38,0:14:48.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人看出这计划的缺陷吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.22,0:14:50.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We need a social catalyst.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.22,0:14:50.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们需要促进一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.81,0:14:54.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like what? We can't get 15-year-old girls drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.81,0:14:54.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比方说什么？我们不能把15岁的女孩灌醉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.85,0:14:57.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Or can we? -No, we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.85,0:14:57.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-可以吗？ -不行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.86,0:15:01.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't think you mean we can't. I think you mean we shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.86,0:15:01.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得你说的不是“不行” 而是我们不应该那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.02,0:15:03.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Howard, you're a Jew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.02,0:15:03.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 霍华德 你是犹太人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.86,0:15:07.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If there was another Wailing Wall exactly like the one in Jerusalem...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.86,0:15:07.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果有一道和在耶路撒冷完全一模一样的哭墙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.24,0:15:10.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but close to taco stands and cheap prescription drugs...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.24,0:15:10.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是离墨西哥卷饼摊和廉价药房很近的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.12,0:15:12.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...would you still wail at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.12,0:15:12.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在那里能哭得出来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.91,0:15:16.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, it's definitely me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.91,0:15:16.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的 这次一定是我的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:21.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We cannot leave this to chance. Let's pick a girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:21.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不能守株待兔 我们选一个女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.04,0:15:23.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and figure out how to get her with Dennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.04,0:15:23.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-想办法让她和丹尼斯在一起 -好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.22,0:15:25.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.22,0:15:25.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.63,0:15:30.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh-uh. I know the type. Cheerleader, student council, goes out with jocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.63,0:15:30.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我最了解那种女孩 啦啦队长 又是学生会的 只跟运动健将约会
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.35,0:15:32.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Won't look at anybody in the gifted program.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.35,0:15:32.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对天才班的人瞧都不瞧一眼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.60,0:15:35.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If she does agree to go out, it turns out to be a setup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.60,0:15:35.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你求了两年 她突然答应约会那一定是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.56,0:15:39.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're in your mom's car with your pants off while the whole football team laughs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.56,0:15:39.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你光着屁股和她在你妈妈的车里 整个橄榄球队的人都在笑你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.98,0:15:46.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Are you crying? -No, I have allergies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.98,0:15:44.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在哭吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.28,0:15:46.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有 是过敏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.49,0:15:48.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Uh....
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.49,0:15:48.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.74,0:15:50.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hey, how about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.74,0:15:50.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 那个怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.70,0:15:54.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure, if he wants to spend years doing her homework...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.70,0:15:54.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没问题 如果他打算给她写上几年的家庭作业
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.58,0:15:57.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...while she drinks herself into a stupor with nonfat White Russians.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.58,0:15:57.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好让她喝个大醉 跟白俄帅哥亲热
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.96,0:16:00.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you're holding her head while she's puking...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.96,0:16:00.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她吐的时候你还得扶着她的头
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.54,0:16:02.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and wishes more guys were like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.54,0:16:02.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她还希望有更多男人像你一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:05.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She gets into Cornell, because you wrote her essay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:05.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后她上了康奈尔大学 因为论文是你帮她写的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.42,0:16:09.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you drive up to visit her one weekend and she acts like she doesn't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.42,0:16:09.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后你有个周末开车去找她 她却装作不认识你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.22,0:16:13.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, so not her either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.22,0:16:13.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 那她也不行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:17.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:17.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那她呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.18,0:16:21.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Interesting, kind of pretty, a little chubby, so probably low self-esteem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.18,0:16:21.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}挺有意思的…可爱 有点肉肉的 所以一定没什么自信
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.23,0:16:22.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think that's our girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.23,0:16:22.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想就是她了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.48,0:16:24.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One of us should go talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.48,0:16:24.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们得有个人过去跟她说话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.27,0:16:26.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't talk to her, you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.27,0:16:26.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没办法 你去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.24,0:16:28.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't just go up and talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.24,0:16:28.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不能没头没脑地跑去找她说话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.36,0:16:29.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard, you talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.36,0:16:29.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 你去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.41,0:16:34.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know, she'll never go for the kid once she gets a peek at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.41,0:16:34.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行 一旦她见过我 就绝对不会喜欢那小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.24,0:16:37.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In India, this would be simpler.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.24,0:16:37.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在印度一切都简单多了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:41.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Five minutes with her dad, 20 goats and a laptop, and we'd be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:41.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}和她爸爸相处五分钟 给二十只羊和一个笔记本 一切搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.50,0:16:43.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, we're not in India.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.50,0:16:43.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们又不在印度
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.21,0:16:45.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't we do it your way, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.21,0:16:45.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 那就用你的办法啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.17,0:16:50.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll arrange for her to move in across the hall so he can pathetically moon over her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.17,0:16:50.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们安排她走来走去 接近丹尼斯 让他迷恋上她
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.43,0:16:54.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Okay, that was uncalled for. -You started it, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.43,0:16:55.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没这个必要 -是你开的头 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.97,0:16:56.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[GLASS CLINKING]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.35,0:16:58.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Could I have everyone's attention, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.35,0:16:58.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请大家注意一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.27,0:17:02.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What a wonderful occasion this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.27,0:17:02.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这真是个美妙的盛会
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.73,0:17:06.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And how fortunate that it should fall on Take Your Daughter to Work Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.73,0:17:06.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}更幸运的是今天恰巧是“带女儿上班”日
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.53,0:17:11.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're here to welcome Mr. Dennis Kim to our little family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.53,0:17:11.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们在此欢迎丹尼斯金先生 加入我们的小家庭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.78,0:17:14.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Welcome, Dennis Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.78,0:17:14.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}欢迎你 丹尼斯金
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.99,0:17:18.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. Kim was not only the valedictorian at Stanford University...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.99,0:17:18.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}金先生不仅是斯坦福大学的毕业致辞生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:24.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...he is also the youngest recipient of the prestigious Stevenson Award.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:24.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他也是久负盛名的史蒂文森奖 有史以来最年轻的得奖人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.50,0:17:26.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Youngest till the cyborgs rise up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.50,0:17:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}生化机器人问世之前最年轻的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.71,0:17:29.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And now, without any further ado...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.71,0:17:29.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 闲话少说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:35.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...let me introduce the man of the hour, Mr. Dennis Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:35.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请容我为大家介绍此刻的主角：丹尼斯金先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.56,0:17:39.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dennis? Dennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.56,0:17:39.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}丹尼斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:41.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:41.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.60,0:17:45.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you like to tell us about your upcoming research?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.60,0:17:45.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要和我们分享一下你即将进行的研究吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.48,0:17:48.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, thanks. I'm going to the mall with Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.48,0:17:48.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用了 谢谢 我要和艾玛去逛商场
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.86,0:17:56.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The kid got a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.86,0:17:56.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这小子居然搞到妹子了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.70,0:17:58.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.70,0:17:58.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.62,0:18:02.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did anyone see how he did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.62,0:18:02.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人看到他如何办到的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.87,0:18:04.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't worry, I've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.87,0:18:04.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别担心 我来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.46,0:18:08.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ladies and gentlemen, honored daughters...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.46,0:18:08.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}女士们先生们 尊敬的女儿们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.59,0:18:11.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...while Mr. Kim, by virtue of his youth and naiveté...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.59,0:18:11.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}金先生 因其年轻和天真
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.92,0:18:15.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...has fallen prey to the inexplicable need for human contact...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.92,0:18:15.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}陷入了难以解释的人际接触的泥潭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.38,0:18:19.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...let me step in and assure you that my research will go on uninterrupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.38,0:18:19.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我郑重向大家宣布 我的研究不会受到任何干扰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.39,0:18:24.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And that social relationships will continue to baffle and repulse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.39,0:18:24.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有 我将继续对社交关系保持困惑以及反感
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.14,0:18:26.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.14,0:18:26.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.06,0:18:28.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CLAPPING]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.15,0:18:31.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-He's back. -Yeah, mission accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.15,0:18:31.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他恢复正常了 -是啊 任务完成
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.44,0:18:34.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Forget the mission. How did that little yutz get a girl on his own?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.44,0:18:34.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别想什么任务了 那个小屁孩是怎么把妹子搞到手的？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.40,0:18:37.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess times have changed since we were young.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.40,0:18:37.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大概和我们那个时代不一样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.78,0:18:39.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Smart is the new sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.78,0:18:39.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}聪明现在是最新的性感
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.70,0:18:43.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then why do we go home alone every night? We're still smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.70,0:18:43.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我们为什么每晚都孤身一人回家？ 我们还是很聪明啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:45.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe we're too smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:45.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许是因为我们太聪明了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.92,0:18:47.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So smart, it's off-putting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.92,0:18:47.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}聪明到让人反感
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.04,0:18:51.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, let's go with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.04,0:18:51.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.30,0:18:55.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.30,0:18:55.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.68,0:18:58.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Components I built are on the space station...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.68,0:18:58.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我造的部件都在空间站了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.43,0:19:01.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I get a ticket for launching a rocket in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.43,0:19:01.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}却因为在公园发射火箭模型被开罚单
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.35,0:19:05.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know if the ticket was so much for the launch as for telling the policewoman:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.35,0:19:05.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得这跟发射火箭模型没有关系 而是因为你对那个女警察说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.44,0:19:08.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"You have to frisk me. I have another rocket in my pants."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.44,0:19:08.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“你一定要搜我的身 我裤子里还有一支火箭”
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.27,0:19:11.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.27,0:19:11.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.36,0:19:14.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's Dennis Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.36,0:19:14.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是丹尼斯金
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.86,0:19:17.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, I almost didn't recognize him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.86,0:19:17.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我差点没认出他来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.45,0:19:19.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I kind of feel bad about what we did to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.45,0:19:19.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们那样对他 我有点内疚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.95,0:19:27.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, we really ruined his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.95,0:19:27.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 我们毁了他的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.79,0:19:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Screw him, he was weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.79,0:19:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}管他呢 都怪他自己意志不坚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.45,0:20:01.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}译者： 吴春燕
